@page "/home2"

<PageTitle>CarbonOne | Carbon Intelligence Platform</PageTitle>

<main class="carbon-one-landing">
    <section class="co-hero">
        <div class="co-orb co-orb-one"></div>
        <div class="co-orb co-orb-two"></div>
        <div class="co-shell">
            <nav class="co-nav" aria-label="CarbonOne navigation">
                <a class="co-brand" href="/home2" aria-label="CarbonOne home">
                    <img src="/images/branding/CarbonOne_CIP_transparent.png" alt="CarbonOne — Carbon Intelligence Platform" />
                </a>
                <div class="co-nav-actions">
                    <a class="co-login" href="/Account/Login">Sign in</a>
                    <a class="co-button co-button-small" href="/Account/Register">Get started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                </div>
            </nav>

            <div class="co-hero-grid">
                <div class="co-hero-copy">
                    <p class="co-eyebrow"><span></span> Built for measurable climate action</p>
                    <h1>Turn carbon data into <em>confident action.</em></h1>
                    <p class="co-lede">CarbonOne brings accounting, operational intelligence, and audit-ready reporting into one clear platform—so every team can measure, decide, and decarbonize with confidence.</p>
                    <div class="co-hero-actions">
                        <a class="co-button" href="/Account/Register">Explore CarbonOne <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
                        <a class="co-text-link" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="co-trust-row">
                        <span>Aligned with</span>
                        <strong>ISO 14064</strong><i></i><strong>TGO</strong><i></i><strong>GHG Protocol</strong>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="co-product-preview" aria-label="Carbon intelligence dashboard preview">
                    <div class="co-preview-topbar"><span class="co-preview-dot"></span><span>Executive overview</span><span class="co-preview-live">LIVE</span></div>
                    <div class="co-preview-content">
                        <div class="co-preview-heading"><div><p>2026 footprint</p><h2>1,284.6 <small>tCO₂e</small></h2></div><span class="co-positive">↓ 12.4%</span></div>
                        <div class="co-chart" aria-hidden="true">
                            <div class="co-chart-grid"></div>
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 520 180" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img">
                                <defs><linearGradient id="area" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#18c38b" stop-opacity=".32"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#18c38b" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs>
                                <path d="M0 146 C40 132 56 121 86 130 S130 118 155 110 S200 122 230 92 S280 99 310 74 S360 86 389 52 S438 61 470 35 S500 41 520 16 L520 180 L0 180 Z" fill="url(#area)"/>
                                <path d="M0 146 C40 132 56 121 86 130 S130 118 155 110 S200 122 230 92 S280 99 310 74 S360 86 389 52 S438 61 470 35 S500 41 520 16" fill="none" stroke="#18c38b" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="4"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="co-scope-grid">
                            <div><span class="co-scope-one"></span><p>Scope 1</p><strong>18%</strong></div><div><span class="co-scope-two"></span><p>Scope 2</p><strong>27%</strong></div><div><span class="co-scope-three"></span><p>Scope 3</p><strong>55%</strong></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="co-floating-card"><span class="co-mini-icon">✓</span><div><small>Data quality</small><strong>94% verified</strong></div><span class="co-floating-up">+6.8%</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="co-logo-band"><div class="co-shell"><p>ONE PLATFORM. ONE TRUSTED CARBON VIEW.</p><div><span>Measure</span><b></b><span>Manage</span><b></b><span>Reduce</span><b></b><span>Report</span></div></div></section>

    <section id="how-it-works" class="co-section co-shell">
        <div class="co-section-intro"><p class="co-eyebrow"><span></span> From evidence to impact</p><h2>Clarity for every carbon decision.</h2><p>Designed for organizations that need more than a carbon number: a dependable operating system for progress.</p></div>
        <div class="co-feature-grid">
            <article class="co-feature co-feature-featured"><span class="co-feature-number">01</span><div class="co-feature-icon">⌁</div><h3>Capture once. Connect everywhere.</h3><p>Bring facility, energy, activity, and supply-chain data into a structured carbon inventory.</p><div class="co-data-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></article>
            <article class="co-feature"><span class="co-feature-number">02</span><div class="co-feature-icon">◌</div><h3>See what matters next.</h3><p>Reveal hotspots, performance trends, and reduction opportunities across Scopes 1, 2, and 3.</p></article>
            <article class="co-feature"><span class="co-feature-number">03</span><div class="co-feature-icon">↗</div><h3>Report with confidence.</h3><p>Generate audit-ready CFO reports and maintain an evidence trail from source data to decision.</p></article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="co-impact"><div class="co-shell co-impact-grid"><div><p class="co-eyebrow"><span></span> Intelligence that moves business</p><h2>Carbon accounting is the beginning—not the finish line.</h2></div><div class="co-impact-copy"><p>Use trusted data to unite operational teams, prioritize investment, and demonstrate credible progress to customers, regulators, and stakeholders.</p><a class="co-text-link co-text-link-light" href="/Account/Login">Open your workspace <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>

    <section class="co-cta co-shell"><div><p class="co-eyebrow"><span></span> Start with certainty</p><h2>Make every tonne count.</h2><p>Build a carbon program your organization can trust and act on.</p></div><a class="co-button" href="/Account/Register">Get started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
</main>
